		(uuid "4e432ac9-92c5-466d-a1ad-ed5e358321e9")
	)
	(text "This assembly negotiates required voltage via USB-C PD. \n\nBreakout boards for this exist, that could be used in place.\n\nOptions: \n5V (up to 15W) \n9V (up to 27W)\n15V (up to 45W)\n20V (up to 100W)\n\nOctopart (ideally DIgikey or Mouser)\nConnect shield to GND\n\nDouble check footprint"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 39.624 104.648 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5baf3bce-42cd-475c-a08a-f3ef2bedfa39")
	)
	(text "Need to duplicate this stage for 2 outputs? YES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 373.634 327.406 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "66804341-010e-4152-adc8-19fcdbbac688")
	)
	(text "HUSB238 symbol:\nhttps://gitlab.postmarketos.org/postmarketOS/phone-harness/-/blob/main/symbols/HUSB238.kicad_sym?ref_type=heads\nhttps://gitlab.postmarketos.org/postmarketOS/phone-harness/-/tree/main/libraries/HUSB238.pretty?ref_type=heads"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 39.624 123.952 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "685dccb2-3524-4352-b5d8-4c157e7c5e8a")
	)
	(text "Wall adapter (high quality, 65-100W USB-C)\n\n    |\n    |\n    v\n\nUSB-C Receptacle and PD Controller\n\n     |\n     V\n\nPower Section\n  - 5V rail → Raspberry Pi 5\n  - 5V or VIN → Cytron RP2040 board\n    - Servo headers → Servos get power here\n    - MCU control signals\n\nPower budget:\nRaspberry Pi 5 can easily run 15W or higher. Official power supply is 27W, so already above the 15W design from the Coffee Heater.\nWe are running image processing algorithms, etc. Also have camera module attached, laser, etc. Assuming full 27W power consumption. \n\nThe Cytron Motor Controller board has the servos attached.\nAt the moment, we are running off USB power (15W).\n\n42W? 15V @ 3A option, may be enough \nWith HUSB - make it jumper-selectable.\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 163.576 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6db98d05-56eb-4b8b-9420-1ce401ccdcdf")
	)
	(text "For Raspberry Pi 5\nUSB-C cable to connect? (power-only)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 352.298 336.042 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a1cbdfdc-59d9-482c-a4be-6b13882cdff6")
	)
	(text "1 input stage splits to 2 outputs, can be turned on/off individually"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 339.344 124.968 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "aef401e4-bfa6-4b5f-b1e0-02ddce09771d")
	)
	(text "For Cytron RP2040 Motor Controller board\nbulk capacitance to prevent spikes?\nGND/PWR screw terminals with 18AWG wire?\n\nConnectors? \n\nEnsure USB-C connector rated up to 5A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 352.552 346.202 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e940b171-7167-4488-b655-8214cda5390c")
	)
